# Saint Agnes Sanatorium (CIPlay saint_agnes_sanatorium): The Lullaby Frequency's second island, quest "Admitted With the
# Song". The terrace (6 m); the day room x -15..-3 z -6..0 (door x -10.5..-9 on z -6; the piano at -6 -2.2); Ward C
# x 3..12 z -6..0 (its door panel x 6..7.5); the veranda x -15..-3 z -12.5..-9.5; the hydrotherapy house x -5..2.5
# z 6..12 (door x -3.5..-2 on z 6); the gate at 0 -30, the vending machine at 9 -17.
island Saint Agnes Sanatorium
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Admitted With the Song
wait 3
expect hidden musicbox
walk 0 -40 to 0 -34
zone gate
expect step 1
walk 0 -26 to 0 -8 to -9.75 -8 to -9.75 -4.6 h=6.2
read Admissions book
expect step 2
read Nurse Edda's rota
expect step 3
use piano
expect shown musicbox
expect story pianoplayed 1
use piano
expect message keeps playing by itself
expect step 4
open Music box
expect story wardckey 1
expect step 5
use wardcdoor
expect hidden wardcdoor
walk 6.75 -8 to 6.75 -4 h=6.2
zone ward_c
expect step 6
read Bed 4 chart
read Bed 7 chart
read Bed 7 chart
expect story chart 2
read Bed 9 chart
expect story chart 3
expect step 7
walk 0 -2 to 0 3 to -2.75 4 to -2.75 7.5 h=6.2
zone hydro
expect step 8
expect hidden drainzone
use crank
expect hidden basinwater
expect shown drainzone
expect step 9
zone drain
wait 2
kill Roach
expect step 10
open Doctor Vell's cabinet
expect step 11
read Vell - final entry
expect done
storespot 0 -18
